cmd-fish_dissolve-desc = Preview a local sprite dissolve effect.
cmd-fish_dissolve-help = fish_dissolve <client EntityUid> <out|in|set|reset> [seconds/amount] [burn|teleport|anomaly|energy] [edge width] [#RRGGBB] [Noise|BottomToTop|TopToBottom] [noise scale]
fish-dissolve-failed = Cannot apply dissolve: invalid parameters, missing sprite, or another PostShader owns the sprite.
